# Cloudflare Web Analytics beacon token.
#
# NOT a secret: Cloudflare renders this value into the page HTML by design.
# It lives here so the value is set per environment rather than hardcoded.
#
# Set the real value in the Cloudflare Pages project environment variables
# (Settings -> Environment variables -> Production), then redeploy. With this
# unset the analytics script renders nothing and the site collects no data.
#
# Find the token: Cloudflare dashboard -> Web Analytics -> tristangrech.com.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CF_BEACON=your-beacon-token-here
